    "title": "Smart Light Smart Home Control",
    "description": "Control all smart devices around home, office, space, etc with Smart Light Smart Home Control. This is a smart device management app to control and manage your smart home devices easier and better.\r\n\r\nOur app is all built with easy controls & smart management by supporting smart wifi & bluetooth devices\r\n- Easily control all smart devices including LED, bulb, strip light, lighting from anywhere\r\n- Create your own schedule by time, weather, locations or even your daily mood\r\n- Set your favorite scenes & settings before you arrive home\r\n- Fast control & connect with one-tap automatic controls\r\n- Share management access with your family and friends\r\n- Stay alert with real-time notifications\r\n- More features to upgrade your smart-home light experience\r\n- More support devices add-on features for LED, smart home light, wifi & bluetooth supports, etc\r\n\r\nOur app is built to support multiple Smart Wifi & Bluetooth gateway devices and compatible with many smart devices: smart home lights, LED, bulb, strip light and more. It enhances all smart home experiences in seamless control within a single app - Smart Light Smart Home Control\r\nWe are creating this New App to serve you better with your smart home experience, and will continue to innovate more in the future, let us be your home assistance starting today!\r\n\r\nTerms of Use: http://metaverselabs.ai/terms-of-use/\r\nPrivacy Policy: http://metaverselabs.ai/privacy-policy/\r\nWe are working our best on making the Smart Light Smart Home Control better and more useful for you. We'd very much appreciate if you have any recommendations/suggestions for us to get good product. Your kind words encourage us greatly. If you have any questions, don't hesitate to contact support email: support@metaverselabs.ai. Thank you.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Control all smart devices around home, office, space, etc with Smart Light Smart Home Control. This is a smart device management app to control and manage your smart home devices easier and better.<br><br>Our app is all built with easy controls &amp; smart management by supporting smart wifi &amp; bluetooth devices<br>- Easily control all smart devices including LED, bulb, strip light, lighting from anywhere<br>- Create your own schedule by time, weather, locations or even your daily mood<br>- Set your favorite scenes &amp; settings before you arrive home<br>- Fast control &amp; connect with one-tap automatic controls<br>- Share management access with your family and friends<br>- Stay alert with real-time notifications<br>- More features to upgrade your smart-home light experience<br>- More support devices add-on features for LED, smart home light, wifi &amp; bluetooth supports, etc<br><br>Our app is built to support multiple Smart Wifi &amp; Bluetooth gateway devices and compatible with many smart devices: smart home lights, LED, bulb, strip light and more. It enhances all smart home experiences in seamless control within a single app - Smart Light Smart Home Control<br>We are creating this New App to serve you better with your smart home experience, and will continue to innovate more in the future, let us be your home assistance starting today!<br><br>Terms of Use: http://metaverselabs.ai/terms-of-use/<br>Privacy Policy: http://metaverselabs.ai/privacy-policy/<br>We are working our best on making the Smart Light Smart Home Control better and more useful for you. We&#39;d very much appreciate if you have any recommendations/suggestions for us to get good product. Your kind words encourage us greatly. If you have any questions, don&#39;t hesitate to contact support email: support@metaverselabs.ai. Thank you.",
